Modifications
-------------
Per Apache License 2.0, section 4(b), the files have been MODIFIED:

  The upstream SVGs ship as `width="192" height="192"` without a `viewBox`.
  `viewBox="0 0 192 192"` was added to the 35 files that lacked one, so that
  Qt's SVG renderer scales them deterministically instead of guessing a size.

No path data, stroke width, colour or artwork was changed.

